vity-board","options":{"number":1,"title":"Cast off and head downriver","target":"Click the steamboat → Program.","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"repeat 18 times","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move X by -6 ft","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 0.3 seconds","depth":1}],"tip":"Downstream a packet made 15 mph and upstream barely 5, because it was fighting the current the whole way. Run this with -6 and then with +6 and the same number of steps takes the boat very different distances in your head, which is exactly the problem a pilot had.","accent":"#9a3226"}},{"id":"7ce16de3-6027-4bc9-a020-eda6702e64bb","createdAt":1786920997298,"transform":{"position":[26,0.04183434843066758,70],"rotation":[0,-0.9652516631899266,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":2,"title":"Pole the pirogue across","target":"Click one of the little dug-out boats → Program.","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move Z by -20 ft","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 2 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 180 degrees","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"move Z by 20 ft","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 2 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 180 degrees","depth":1}],"tip":"A pirogue is dug from a single cypress log and draws a few inches, so it goes where the steamboat cannot. The rotate blocks only turn it to face the way it is going — move Z always runs along the world’s Z, whichever way the boat points.","accent":"#6b5842"}},{"id":"0acbbf40-6621-4fe7-87cd-7e88f7d8d792","createdAt":1786920997300,"transform":{"position":[-4,15.99996757605274,-30],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#f2a541"},{"id":"15ad036d-ce57-4d72-9084-913e826e916a","createdAt":1786920997301,"transform":{"position":[-30,9.99815628672378,-14],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#f2a541"},{"id":"2115b87d-f8d2-4823-a240-26b164546d0b","create